---
interface Props {
  /** class of the paragraphs: 'text' on the Sanctuary page, 'p-text' elsewhere */
  cls?: string;
}
const { cls = 'p-text' } = Astro.props;
---

  <p class={cls}><strong>Programming:</strong> Shir Seroussi, Eden Avrahami, Yonatan Sheffer</p>
  <p class={cls}><strong>Art and Design:</strong> Ksenia Spirina, Maya Bell</p>
  <p class={cls}><strong>Guidance:</strong> Yuval Markovich, Danielle Mossak, Omer Zadok</p>
  <p class={cls}><strong>Assistance:</strong> Sagie Levy</p>
  <p class:list={[cls, 'keep-host']}>
    The game was created as an assignment in course “Game&nbsp;Lab” of the
    <span class="keep-name">Visual <span class="keep-always">Communication Department</span></span> of
    <span class="keep-name"><span class="keep-always">Bezalel Academy of Arts and</span> Design</span> 2025.
  </p>
